---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GuideCard from '../components/GuideCard.astro';
import { guides } from '../data/guides';
const featured = guides.slice(0, 4);
---
<Layout title="Scavland Wiki — Survival RPG, Weapons & Loot" description="Explore Scavland with guides for survival, weapons, quests, loot, factions, the Mist, crafting, and everything you need to survive Zalesye and more." keywords="Scavland, PC, survival RPG, weapons, loot, quests, factions, Mist, crafting" canonical="/">
  <Fragment slot="schema"><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({ '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebSite', name:'Scavland Wiki', url:'https://scavland.wiki', potentialAction:{'@type':'SearchAction',target:'https://scavland.wiki/search/?q={search_term_string}', 'query-input':'required name=search_term_string'} })} /></Fragment>
  <section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Fan-made community wiki · Official media</p><h1>Scavland</h1><p class="lede">Scavland is a hardcore top-down pixel art survival RPG set in a post-apocalyptic Soviet world. Explore Zalesye, scavenge abandoned places, take dangerous jobs, fight mutants and hostile survivors, and uncover the mystery of the deadly Mist.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/guide/scavland-beginner-guide/">Start beginner guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/guide/scavland-weapons-and-attachments/">Explore weapons &amp; gear</a><a class="button secondary" href="/guide/scavland-quests-and-contracts/">Explore quests &amp; loot</a></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>Sep 04, 2026</strong><span>Early Access</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>100K+</strong><span>Steam wishlists</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>25+</strong><span>Weapons</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>300+</strong><span>Attachments</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h2>Your Scavland journey</h2></div><p>Every page distinguishes official claims from demonstrations and tests. Follow the question you actually have.</p></div><div class="guide-grid">{featured.map((guide) => <GuideCard guide={guide} />)}</div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The evidence desk</p><h2>Look before you leap</h2></div><p>Authorized screenshots and video clips make the site useful now; versioned testing will turn field notes into dependable tables later.</p></div><div class="media-strip"><img src="/images/screenshots/ss_08_overworld_map.jpg" alt="Authorized Scavland overworld map reference" loading="lazy"/><img src="/images/screenshots/ss_05_inventory_management.jpg" alt="Authorized Scavland inventory screen" loading="lazy"/><img src="/images/screenshots/ss_09_radioactive_zone.jpg" alt="Authorized Scavland hazardous zone" loading="lazy"/></div><p class="caption">Media source: user-provided authorized asset pack · Evidence level: Community demonstration · Mechanics require separate verification.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="note"><strong>Release watch</strong><br/>The Steam listing and developer announcements are the current source of truth for launch timing and feature scope. This site will update its field notes when the Early Access build makes mechanics testable.</div></section>
  <section class="section about-home"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The game</p><h2>What is Scavland?</h2></div></div><div class="prose"><p>Scavland is a hardcore top-down pixel art survival RPG set in Zalesye, a post-apocalyptic land devastated by war and the mysterious Mist. You play as a Vulture, a scavenger who survives by exploring dangerous locations, finding useful supplies, completing jobs, and fighting mutants and hostile survivors.</p><p>Survival depends on preparation, careful combat, inventory management, trading, and knowing when to push deeper into the wasteland. The handcrafted open world includes abandoned settlements, bunkers, forests, irradiated swamps, factions, NPCs, quests, hidden locations, and dangerous underground areas.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/guide/">Explore all guides</a></div></section>
  <section class="section final-cta"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next run</p><h2>Ready to master Scavland?</h2></div><p>From your first scavenging run to dangerous bunkers, faction quests, rare loot and the mysteries of the Mist, keep the evidence close.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/guide/scavland-beginner-guide/">Read the beginner guide</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3373500/Scavland/" rel="noreferrer">Play on Steam</a></div></section>
</Layout>
